Desvanecimento---consultar cap. 3.3 [1]\t\t\tc0 = 6\n\t1.14.  \
Desvanecimento---consultar cap. 3.3 [1]\t\t\tclat = 0\n\t1.14.  \
Desvanecimento---consultar cap. 3.3 [1]\t\t\tclong = 3\n\t1.14.  \
