\[AAcute]ria para cumprir a cl\[AAcute]usula ESR \[EAcute] \
(\!\(\*FractionBox[\(C\), \(N\)]\)\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\()\), \(CIP_ESR\)]\)=", \

